@startuml
[*] --> NotRegistered : Initial state

NotRegistered --> Citizen : Register
Citizen --> LoggedInCitizen : Login
LoggedInCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : UploadDocuments
LoggedInCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : ViewProfile
LoggedInCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : ApplyForCertificate
LoggedInCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : ContinueUploadingDocuments
LoggedInCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : ReapplyForCertificate
LoggedInCitizen --> NotRegistered : EndSession

Registrar --> NotRegistered : Register
NotRegistered --> Registrar : Login
Registrar --> LoggedInRegistrar : RequestCertificate
LoggedInRegistrar --> LoggedInRegistrar : ReapplyForCertificate

LoggedInCitizen --> [*] : Final state
LoggedInRegistrar --> [*] : Final state
@enduml
